Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bacura, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.33,0:01:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you taken us to the Shadow Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bacura, Bacura's no longer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not Bacura, then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.07,0:01:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a thief and a stealer of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.59,0:01:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have done terrible things in my\Nquest to possess the Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You do remember the legends, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.33,0:01:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Whosoever wields all seven Millennium\Nitems will possess power unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And before I'm done with you, your\NMillennium puzzle will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not going to\Nhappen, whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let the Shadow Game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.93,0:01:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The first move is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And my first card, the Cyber\NCommander, Tristan's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.76,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:01:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura must have used\Nhis Millennium Ring to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,capture Tristan's soul\Nwithin his favorite card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's your little friend, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks pretty tough,\Nbut can he deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The white magical hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.73,0:02:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I must still be dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all just a really bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like that card's been defeated and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.77,0:02:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,your poor friend's soul\Nwas trapped within it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done with Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend is gone on his\Nway to the discard pile
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,or the graveyard as we\Ncall it in Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan can't be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,man this place is creeping me out big\Ntime but how'd i get here i remember being
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,attacked and the next thing i know i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,wandering around this\Ngraveyard huh what's this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,no according to this tombstone\Ni'm dead but this can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When you duel in the Shadow Realm,\Nthe stakes are always higher, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a sloppy move, and now your\Nfriend, he paid for it with his very soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which of your friends\Nwill you sacrifice next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd avoid using the cards that have my\Nfriend's souls trapped in them if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But to save my friends, I have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I only have one card that\Ncan beat his white magical hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's favorite card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flame Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.71,0:04:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.15,0:04:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I finally cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul has been sealed\Ninside your favorite card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.35,0:04:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've become the Flame Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't win this duel, we\Ncan't restore you to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're defeated in this battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be carried off to the card\NGraveyard just like Tristan was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for me to win this duel,\Nrestore you all back to your bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.53,0:04:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and get us out of the Shadow\NRealm, I'm going to need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.11,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay? Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I figure I lost my mind,\Nbut I'm gonna go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who wants a beating, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know I'm nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like six inches tall, wearing a\Ndress, about to fight my giant friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not really Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,An evil spirit from his Millennium\NRing has taken him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have no idea what you're\Ntalking about, so here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:04:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the cat in the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.57,0:05:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it, Yugi. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's his turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.05,0:05:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little swordsman got lucky\Nlast time, Yuki, but not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,huh why'd he play that face down\Nbecause he's afraid of what joey the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,swordsman will do to it hang on joey\Nit could be a trap i'm going in wait
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.89,0:05:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,what a dolt it was a morphing jar Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A Morphin Jar? Did I screw up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,When a Morphin Jar is attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,all cards in both players'\Nhands go to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just really lucky that I didn't have\NTaya's soul card in my hand right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, Yook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my favorite card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But is it also my soul card?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens when I play it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With a new hand, comes\Na whole new perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The game, ever-shifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,New dangers surround every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.83,0:06:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to freak me out, but I\Ncan't figure out what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to have to risk playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll play a magic card that lets\Nme revive monsters from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Reborn the Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.19,0:06:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...? Joey? Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys dreaming this too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't no dream, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just me going insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Saw one big delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But just one second ago, I was up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:06:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're down here, who's that up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Don't you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have noticed that\Nsometimes when I duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it feels as if someone is guiding me. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And sometimes it's like\NI can hear a strong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,voice calling out to me\Nfrom my Millennium puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,An ancient, powerful voice. Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what it's all about, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty sure we can\Ntrust him, whoever he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if the big guy is okay in your\Nbook, then he's okay by me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should try and find Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She must still be in the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we should try and win this\Nthing before her card gets played.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bash me some\NBakura. Hang on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just played, so I have to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Another morphing jar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:08:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to send all the cards in\Nour hands to the graveyard again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.09,0:08:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I did the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magician of Faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, isn't that Teya's favorite card?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you suppose that her mortal\Nsoul is trapped within it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should play it and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again, you don't\Nknow what I'm laying here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.97,0:08:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so you might be putting her in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And while you decide, I'll just\Nactivate this trap card. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just Desserts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find it will help you come\Nto grips with your present situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.79,0:08:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just Desserts takes 500 points from\Neach of your monsters on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll feel like each and every point\Nhas been ripped from your beating heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Yugi, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but one more attack\Nlike that, and it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that trap card just\Nnailed Yugi's life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I should say, our life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Another hit like that, and it\Ncould be over for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.77,0:09:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya's soul card is not safe in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. Uh, guys? Stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little early for\NHalloween, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the... What's this? Shush.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura and Yugi are big dueling\Ngiants and are fighting for our souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, the big guy's not really\Nme, but he's not really not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's complicated,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but it has something to do with the\NMillennium Items Bakura and I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.67,0:09:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not unless we're all going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think of it this way, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's two Yugi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The cool one up there and\Nthe puny one down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how it works at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget that here I have the\Npowers of the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Yugi, I wouldn't do that if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you who's puny around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was, it's making me go numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, pal! Yu-Gi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't attack the electric lizard\Nwithout some rather shocking feedback.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A lesson your little\NYuge won't soon forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.69,0:10:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:11:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, soul stealer, I'll\Nplay my next card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see her perfectly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have all four of you\Nright where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Helpless on the field, easy\Nprey for my man-eater bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Man-eater bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, what's that card do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The man-eater bug can\Nautomatically destroy one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,creature on the field as\Nsoon as it's flipped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.47,0:11:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's certainly not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, I really don't want to\Ngo back to that graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us are going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll destroy that bug before he plays it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.91,0:11:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't work. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.89,0:11:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment we make an attack,\Nthat card will activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Graveyard, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Yug?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That one of us is going\Nto end up worm food?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that there's only one way out\Nof this, and we're standing on it. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The trap card Big Yugi laid down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm afraid to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.79,0:12:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The card requires that\Nwe sacrifice a creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Taya. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Tristan. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That man-eater bug's gonna take\None of us out no matter what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At least this way, I'm taking it out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.95,0:12:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess you disagreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got back from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone's going, it's me. Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.67,0:12:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How tough can this bug be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get Yugi! Use the trap!\NDo it! Do it now! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want my friends to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrifice me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm activating a trap, sacrificing\Nmy flame swordsman to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Horn of Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Blasting its celestial tune\Ndirectly at your man-eater bug,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,obliterating him from the\Nfield once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,he's gone just like that\Nmy best buddies gone don't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,worry you'll soon be\Njoining him in the graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you can spend an eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,together the graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty creepy but they got\Ntristan back So maybe... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reaper of Cards, and he's come for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't harbor\Nany illusions about
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.03,0:13:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,rescuing your friend\NJoey from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:14:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already played Reborn the\NMonster, the only way to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon the Reaper of Cards\Nwill claim his soul forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He sacrificed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.95,0:14:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.65,0:14:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she's the Magician of Faith
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya's tear activated the magic\Neffect of her favorite card
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right And the effect of\Nthe Magician of Faith Allows me to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,bring back one magic card from the\Ndiscard pile And add it to my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And the card I choose, Reborn\Nthe Monster, which I play now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You waste your time and your turns\Nrescuing these foolish mortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are never a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll move, and you will lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the play that will end the\Nmatch and win me your Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I will play the Lady\Nof Faith in attack mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and then the card that will turn\Nyour friends against one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Change of Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of Heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Bakura's favorite card?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And a very magical card it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,With this card, I can turn\Nyou against your comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The very friends you sought to\Nprotect you will now destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.91,0:15:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't have a choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The change of heart card allows me\Nto control any opposing monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and I choose you, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the young one out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,By simply destroying him,\NI defeat you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here to guide and protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then protect him against this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, so your soul was sealed\Ninto your favorite card, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help, but we\Nmust act quickly, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken over one of his\Ncards instead of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll control her while you attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can win against the\Nevil Bakura. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.99,0:16:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be destroying you,\Nsending you to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.85,0:16:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than being\Nenslaved by an evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it! Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If the evil power of Bakura's Millennium\NRing can pull souls from people,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps the power of my Millennium\NPuzzle can put them back. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Bakura's back where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But where's the evil dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be. Listen closely,\NYugi. Use the power of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,magician send him to the graveyard\Nno you got it dark magic attack
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the millennium puzzle was almost mine
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Pakora? I am now, thanks\Nto you. Where did you get your Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,ring my father picked it up on one\Nof his trips he told me it's from
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:18:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient Egypt. I think that's where\Nthey're all from. He was shopping in a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,merchant bazaar when the millennium\Nring caught his eye the man who sold
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the ring to my father said it had\Nsomething to do with duel monsters but
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,that never made any sense to me since\Nthe card game is new and the ring
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,is clearly ancient when my father\Ngot back he gave it to me he said he
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,felt i was destined to have it i just dreamt\Nbakura went totally mental. Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time I snoozed with\Ndueling cards under my pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.49,0:18:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep well, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.07,0:18:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off. You grab me. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.17,0:18:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I dreamt we were dressed as duel\Nmonsters, and there were two Yugi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever it is,\Nwe'll face it together.
